  "sourceTitle": "Cabbage Fry",
  "sourceText": "Cabbage Fry\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, December 11, 2009 - 11:36pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 sm. head green cabbage, shredded\n1 tablespoon cooking oil\n2 green onions, chopped\n1/4 teaspoon garlic, fresh or powder\n1/2 teaspoon salt\n1/2 teaspoon sugar\n1/2 cup chopped ham\nPepper and salt to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cook cabbage in oil, over medium heat, for 2 minutes, stirring constantly. Add remaining ingredients and toss. Cook about 3 minutes.",
